<title>SWEDEN: Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn to cooperate with PDT.</title>
<headline>Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn to cooperate with PDT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish/American drug company Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc said it signed an agreement with PDT of the U.S. to jointly develop SnET2, a drug being developed to treat eye diseases.</p>
</text>
